<title>SOUTH AFRICA: STOCKBROKER ADMITTED AS S.AFRICA JSE MEMBER.</title>
<headline>STOCKBROKER ADMITTED AS S.AFRICA JSE MEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African stockbroking firm, Societe General Frankel Pollak Ltd will be admitted as a corporate entity member of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange from November 30, the JSE said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The entity would have limited liability, it said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
